OL,3,GNEWSARemembrance events to be held
OL,4,Aacross Yorkshire
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommunities across Yorkshire will come
OL,7,Ftogether this weekend to mark
OL,8,FRemembrance Sunday.
OL,10,FResidents, military personnel, veterans
OL,11,Fand local organisations will honour the
OL,12,Flives of those killed in service on
OL,13,FSunday 8 November.
OL,15,FA two-minute silence will be observed
OL,16,Fnationally at 11:00 GMT, while a number
OL,17,Fof dedicated services and parades are
OL,18,Fbeing held across the region.
OL,20,FYou can find a list of some of the
OL,21,Fevents happening in your area below.
